mydotfiles — run: dots

Keyboard
  Linux/WSL (fzf widget)
    Ctrl-R   fuzzy history
    Ctrl-T   fuzzy file → insert path
    Alt-C    fuzzy directory → cd
  Inside any fzf picker
    type to filter · ↑/↓ or Ctrl-J/K · Enter select · Esc cancel
  PowerShell
    Ctrl-R   PSReadLine history search
    bins     fuzzy pick a command on PATH (needs fzf)

Navigation (zoxide)
  z src          jump to frecent dir matching "src"
  z proj app     match multiple tokens
  zi             interactive picker (also uses fzf if present)
  (no cd override — plain cd still works)

Tool versions (mise)
  mise ls / mise ls-remote <tool>
  mise use -g python@3.12     (global default already pinned)
  mise install                install tools from config / mise.toml
  mise exec -- <cmd>          run with project tool versions
  Project repos own Flipper/ufbt/firmware — not this dotfiles repo

Command runner (just) — from this checkout
  just                        list recipes
  just check                  scripts/ci-check.sh
  just apply / diff / update  chezmoi against this source
  just dots                   print cheat sheet

Search
  rg TODO                    content search (smart-case, hidden, skip .git)
  rg -t py HTTPError         by type
  rg -g '*.toml' pin         by glob
  fd readme                  find files by name
  fd -e md                   by extension
  fd -t d config             directories only
  bins                       fuzzy list executables on PATH

Git (delta pager is automatic)
  git diff | git show | git log -p | git lg
  git st · co · sw · br · ci · last · lg · amend
  gsw / gco                  fzf branch → switch / checkout

Editor / pager
  $EDITOR   preferred-editor (Cursor → Antigravity → VS Code → nvim/vim/vi)
  PAGER     less -FRX when available

SSH
  setup-ssh [--gh] [--gl] [--copy host] [--identity path]

Bootstrap
  ./bootstrap.sh | .\bootstrap.ps1   [--ssh|-Ssh] [-SkipWsl]
